<p><img src="https://cdn.blot.im/blog_177bc256f0ee469c998e912e20ece048/_image_cache/8da879df-9d42-4b4d-84ca-80a2835a1a2f/pasted-percent20image-percent2020260504104312.png" alt="A large moneybag emoji pointing toward a large envelope emoji with a smiling face; 8 smaller envelopes are in two rows of 4 on the right hand side" width="2098" height="1512"> <em>Illustration made by putting emojis together in Affinity</em></p>
